BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:City Council meetings are held on the first and third Monday of
  each month. The meetings are re-scheduled to the next Tuesday when it con
 flicts with a City holiday that falls on a Monday meeting date. The start 
 time is published once the agenda is finalized and posted online. Per Stat
 e law\, agendas are posted at least three business days prior to the date 
 of the meeting. Residents may sign-up through the “Mesquite Messenger”
  function on the City’s website to receive email notification when a new
  City Council agenda is posted. https://www.cityofmesquite.com/calendar.as
 px?EID=11929
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20271220T235900
